# Gameplay smoke test (see docs/REPLAY.md). Run via tools/regress.sh, which uses a
# sandboxed --game-dir so no real savegames are touched.
#
# Boot -> skip intro -> main menu -> Spielen -> Neues Spiel -> skip story book ->
# first room l/001 (monologue) -> hotspot highlighter -> exit "Tür" -> room l/005.
#! threshold 03_l001_hotspots 0.12   (hotspot markers pulse with wall-clock time)
wait video 60
1000 tap Escape
wait menu 60
1500 expect menu
+0 shot 01_main_menu
+0 hash main_menu
+0 click 60 553
wait room x/006 30
1500 shot 02_chapter_select
+0 click 114 566
+2000 tap Escape
wait room l/001 30
3000 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+11000 expect hotspots 15
+0 move 400 120
+500 key down Space
+700 shotfull 03_l001_hotspots
+0 key up Space
+300 shot 04_l001
+0 clickspot Tür
wait room l/005 30
4000 expect room l/005
+0 shot 05_l005
+0 hotspots
+500 quit
